OL,3,AThe wealthy Cuban Americans ready and
OL,4,Awaiting for Havana to fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the lavish home of one of Miami's
OL,7,Ftop plastic surgeons, overlooking the
OL,8,FBiscayne Bay, some of the wealthiest
OL,9,FCuban-American families in Florida have
OL,10,Fgathered.
OL,12,FThey are there to thrash out their
OL,13,Fvision of Cuba's future at the fourth
OL,14,Fmeeting of the newly created
OL,15,FCuban-American National Chamber of
OL,16,FCommerce (CANCC).
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
