OL,3,AThe wealthy Cuban Americans ready and
OL,4,Awaiting for Havana to fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FRum in hand and Rolexes on wrists, this
OL,7,Fis Miami's old money. People with
OL,8,Fwell-recognised Cuban-American surnames
OL,9,F` like Bacardi and Babun ` chat around
OL,10,Fthe pool about the lamentable state of
OL,11,Fthe island's economy, and share titbits
OL,12,Fof gossip about the latest political
OL,13,Frumblings.
OL,15,F"The intention of this evening is to
OL,16,Fgather under one roof the most
OL,17,Fprominent Cuban-American entrepreneurs
OL,18,Fin Miami-Dade County," says CANCC
OL,19,Fpresident Juan Omar Sixto, "and the
OL,20,Fobjective is to be in Cuba once the
OL,21,Fregime falls".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
